<title>USA: DOT April report of U.S. airline performance.</title>
<headline>DOT April report of U.S. airline performance.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Transportation Department Air Travel Consumer Report on the performance of the 10 largest U.S. air carriers in domestic non-stop flights.</p>
<p>    ON-TIME ARRIVALS - -   COMPLAINTS - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    Percent Arriving	 Total Number Per   Mishandled Bags/</p>
<p>    On Time Per Carrier    100,000 Passengers  1,000Passengers</p>
<p> -	   Apr97  Mar97     Apr97  Apr96	 Apr97  Apr96</p>
<p> Alaska     80.7   81.1     0.30    0.00	 5.76    4.51</p>
<p> Amer.West  77.8   78.8     1.38    1.18	 2.94    4.06</p>
<p> American   77.9   77.8     1.33    0.69	 4.72    5.13</p>
<p> Cont.'l    79.5   77.8     1.12    0.45	 3.18    3.39</p>
<p>    ON-TIME ARRIVALS - -   COMPLAINTS - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>    Percent Arriving	 Total Number Per   Mishandled Bags/</p>
<p>    On Time Per Carrier    100,000 Passengers  1,000Passengers</p>
<p> -	   Apr97  Mar97     Apr97  Apr96	 Apr97  Apr96</p>
<p> Delta	75.6   74.8     0.72    0.75	 4.27    4.47</p>
<p> Northwest  78.4   67.7     1.59    0.50	 4.77    4.14</p>
<p> Southwest  84.2   84.7     0.25    0.18	 3.34    3.51</p>
<p> TWA	  83.8   77.5     0.95    1.32	 4.09    5.15</p>
<p> United     81.6   80.1     0.93    0.90	 5.51    4.83</p>
<p> USAirways  80.6   80.7     0.81    0.82	 4.19    4.25</p>
<p> Total	79.8   78.1     0.95    0.69	 4.35    4.38</p>
<p>The percent of on-time arrivals is based on reports from the 28 airports required to report by the DOT plus voluntary reports from other airports.</p>
<p>The consumer complaints portion of the report is based on complaints made to DOT in writing, by telephone or in person. DOT said it has not determined the validity of the complaints.</p>
<p>Total passenger complaints include flight delays, mishandled bags and oversales. They do not concern charges of safety violations, which are handled by the Federal Aviation Administration.</p>
